00:05:50.720 --> 00:05:54.960
(Three Days Later
May 26, 1994)

00:05:55.079 --> 00:05:57.560
Two, three, four.

00:05:58.000 --> 00:06:01.519
Five, six, seven, eight.

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:05.639
Two, two, three, four.

00:06:06.040 --> 00:06:09.600
Five, six, seven, eight.

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:13.519
Three, two, three, four.

00:06:13.680 --> 00:06:14.040
Na.

00:06:14.279 --> 00:06:15.600
Five, six.

00:06:15.759 --> 00:06:16.199
Na.

00:06:16.279 --> 00:06:17.639
Seven, eight.

00:06:17.959 --> 00:06:21.480
Four, two, three, four.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:25.560
Five, six, seven, eight.

00:06:26.079 --> 00:06:29.480
One, two, three, four.

00:06:29.759 --> 00:06:32.399
Five, six, seven.

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.519
Daily inspections are so annoying.

00:06:35.199 --> 00:06:36.759
These dumb eye exercises are useless.

00:06:38.639 --> 00:06:39.000
Na.

00:06:39.399 --> 00:06:40.600
Tell your dad

00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.879
to get rid of these stupid

00:06:41.920 --> 00:06:42.600
eye exercises.

00:06:45.839 --> 00:06:46.319
Na.

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:49.120
Na.

00:06:52.519 --> 00:06:54.279
Na, what's wrong today?

00:06:56.959 --> 00:06:57.680
Nothing.

00:07:01.839 --> 00:07:03.160
Su Lin missed class today.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.319
Did something happen?

00:07:06.360 --> 00:07:07.480
What could've happened?

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.720
She fell into a sewer

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.759
and is probably crying at home.

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:12.519
But the teacher already...

00:07:13.079 --> 00:07:14.839
Na said she's fine.

00:07:15.160 --> 00:07:15.959
Don't you get it?

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:20.560
Na.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.199
I heard the water tower is haunted.

00:07:22.480 --> 00:07:24.360
I don't buy that superstitious stuff.

00:07:39.560 --> 00:07:40.920
(Su Lin missed class today.)

00:07:41.839 --> 00:07:43.120
(Did something happen?)

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:45.439
Su Lin.

00:07:46.560 --> 00:07:47.879
(Look at you, Su Lin.)

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:49.120
(A weapon? Seriously?)

00:07:49.360 --> 00:07:50.199
(Stay back!)

00:07:54.519 --> 00:07:55.439
None matched.

00:07:55.560 --> 00:07:56.000
Right.

00:07:56.959 --> 00:07:57.680
Very strange.

00:07:58.600 --> 00:07:59.759
They're so young.

00:07:59.839 --> 00:08:01.000
Their parents should've been

00:08:01.160 --> 00:08:02.000
very concerned

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:02.879
if they'd gone missing.

00:08:03.639 --> 00:08:05.600
But so far, no one's reported.

00:08:06.439 --> 00:08:08.879
Captain, is it possible that

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:11.879
the kids just went missing,

00:08:12.319 --> 00:08:13.560
and their parents haven't realized it,

00:08:13.839 --> 00:08:14.680
so no report yet.

00:08:15.800 --> 00:08:16.600
Try to contact

00:08:16.839 --> 00:08:18.360
local radio, television,

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:19.319
and newspapers.

00:08:19.800 --> 00:08:21.079
Release information about the victims

00:08:21.319 --> 00:08:22.519
and ask the public for any leads.

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:24.000
Yes, sir.

00:08:35.000 --> 00:08:36.840
Was that your son?

00:08:37.559 --> 00:08:39.320
He's my sister's son.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:41.639
Your nephew calls you Mom and Dad?

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:47.200
He looks

00:08:47.200 --> 00:08:48.399
about ten years old.

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:52.120
An out-of-quota child.

00:08:52.840 --> 00:08:54.000
You have two children.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:55.600
Honey...

00:08:55.679 --> 00:08:56.639
Not registered.

00:08:57.120 --> 00:08:58.519
Forced to stay hidden.

00:08:58.519 --> 00:08:59.679
You can't afford the fine.

00:09:01.279 --> 00:09:02.679
Poor kid.

00:09:03.080 --> 00:09:05.360
What kind of parents are you?

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:08.000
Threatening me?

00:09:10.919 --> 00:09:11.480
Su.

00:09:12.639 --> 00:09:14.679
Can you quit being so hostile?

00:09:16.399 --> 00:09:17.559
You know

00:09:17.799 --> 00:09:18.480
who I am.

00:09:19.399 --> 00:09:21.120
I can help you.

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:25.879
What do you mean?

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:28.440
You know what I mean.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:36.120
Listen carefully.

00:09:37.159 --> 00:09:40.279
For this son of yours,

00:09:42.559 --> 00:09:43.279
I'll pay the fine,

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.440
get him registered,

00:09:46.120 --> 00:09:47.000
find him a school,

00:09:47.360 --> 00:09:49.200
and give him an education.

00:09:49.200 --> 00:09:50.480
He can live like a person,

00:09:50.480 --> 00:09:51.919
out in the open.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:57.399
What exactly

00:09:57.399 --> 00:09:59.080
did your girl do?

00:09:59.519 --> 00:10:01.320
Two girls their age

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:02.440
had a disagreement.

00:10:02.759 --> 00:10:04.000
What could happen?

00:10:04.200 --> 00:10:05.919
They only shoved each other.

00:10:06.240 --> 00:10:06.919
What else?

00:10:06.919 --> 00:10:08.679
You think my girl killed yours?

00:10:09.519 --> 00:10:11.080
Once I learned they had a fight,

00:10:11.080 --> 00:10:11.919
didn't I come

00:10:11.919 --> 00:10:12.799
straight here?

00:10:13.000 --> 00:10:13.360
Right?

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:15.679
I apologized for my daughter.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.039
But once I arrived,

00:10:17.039 --> 00:10:18.720
I learned Su Lin had run away.

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:20.759
Then I did all I could to find her.

00:10:21.200 --> 00:10:22.159
That's all.

00:10:23.480 --> 00:10:24.120
Honey.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:27.720
You can't trust him.

00:10:28.200 --> 00:10:29.159
Why would our girl

00:10:29.159 --> 00:10:30.759
just run away from home?

00:10:32.399 --> 00:10:33.279
It's been three days,

00:10:33.279 --> 00:10:35.120
and you haven't found a thing.

00:10:35.720 --> 00:10:37.000
We need the police.

00:10:37.000 --> 00:10:38.440
We should report her missing.

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:40.720
You two

00:10:40.960 --> 00:10:42.080
are so naive.

00:10:42.559 --> 00:10:44.320
How many times must I tell you?

00:10:44.559 --> 00:10:45.279
Call the police,

00:10:46.720 --> 00:10:48.279
and I'll stop searching for her.

00:10:48.799 --> 00:10:50.080
You'll also lose your job.

00:10:50.720 --> 00:10:51.759
Without a job,

00:10:52.120 --> 00:10:53.360
how will you feed your family?

00:10:54.639 --> 00:10:56.159
You'll drag my daughter into it.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.440
Everyone loses.

00:10:58.960 --> 00:11:00.000
If you don't call them,

00:11:01.159 --> 00:11:02.000
your job is safe,

00:11:02.720 --> 00:11:04.159
I can keep searching,

00:11:04.759 --> 00:11:06.320
my daughter stays out of it,

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:08.039
and I can register your son.

00:11:09.000 --> 00:11:10.240
Everyone wins.

00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:12.840
How about that?

00:11:18.399 --> 00:11:19.159
Honey.

00:11:19.679 --> 00:11:21.159
Don't listen to him.

00:11:21.240 --> 00:11:21.759
Su.

00:11:22.840 --> 00:11:23.919
Do me this favor,

00:11:24.720 --> 00:11:25.519
and from now on,

00:11:25.519 --> 00:11:26.679
I'll get you the best jobs.

00:11:27.799 --> 00:11:28.840
Besides, doing this

00:11:29.000 --> 00:11:30.720
won't stop you finding Su Lin.

00:11:32.320 --> 00:11:33.759
Once she's found,

00:11:34.279 --> 00:11:35.120
your life

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:36.480
will also get better.

00:11:37.440 --> 00:11:38.480
As for me,

00:11:38.600 --> 00:11:39.519
I only want

00:11:39.519 --> 00:11:41.000
to keep my daughter out of this.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:42.320
Nothing more.

00:11:46.679 --> 00:11:48.039
I must have Su Lin back.

00:11:49.279 --> 00:11:50.200
Nothing else matters.

00:11:51.120 --> 00:11:52.799
I promise I'll find your daughter,

00:11:54.200 --> 00:11:55.080
only if you don't report.

00:12:18.759 --> 00:12:19.159
Fine.

00:12:19.399 --> 00:12:19.879
Su.

00:12:19.919 --> 00:12:20.519
It's settled.

00:12:21.639 --> 00:12:21.960
Okay.

00:12:21.960 --> 00:12:23.480
I'll tell you when it's done.

00:12:27.879 --> 00:12:28.559
All right. Bye.

00:12:30.080 --> 00:12:30.840
Goodbye, Mr. Ma.

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:40.000
You had company?

00:12:52.559 --> 00:12:54.639
Why didn't you call the police?

00:12:55.720 --> 00:12:57.480
Why?

00:12:57.600 --> 00:12:58.720
Why?

00:12:58.840 --> 00:12:59.919
Someone's outside.

00:13:06.519 --> 00:13:07.600
You...

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:29.840
(Ladies and gentlemen.)

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:31.559
(We interrupt with a news bulletin.)

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:34.159
(Police recently found
the body of a young woman)

00:13:34.159 --> 00:13:35.240
(in Weihong Canal.)

00:13:35.799 --> 00:13:38.399
(The victim remains unidentified)

00:13:38.720 --> 00:13:39.480
(and is believed to)

00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:41.120
(have been between 18 and 20 years old.)

00:13:41.720 --> 00:13:43.000
(Anyone with information...)

00:13:43.279 --> 00:13:45.639
Why?

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.159
What else could I do?

00:13:50.080 --> 00:13:52.240
What would happen to Su Zhe?

00:14:00.759 --> 00:14:02.320
Honey.

00:14:03.879 --> 00:14:05.240
Lin.

00:14:07.440 --> 00:14:08.639
Lin.

00:14:11.519 --> 00:14:12.879
Lin.

00:14:19.919 --> 00:14:22.080
(Red alert for torrential rain.)

00:14:22.240 --> 00:14:24.120
(From 8:00 a.m.
on the 23rd until midnight,)

00:14:24.200 --> 00:14:25.240
(Chaobei is expected to experience)

00:14:25.320 --> 00:14:26.759
(May 23, 1994)
(heavy to torrential rain.)

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:28.320
(Some areas may see severe rainstorms.)

00:14:28.799 --> 00:14:29.879
(Residents are advised)

00:14:29.879 --> 00:14:30.919
(to take precautions.)

00:14:31.240 --> 00:14:32.600
(Government departments
and relevant agencies)

00:14:32.679 --> 00:14:33.679
(should implement)

00:14:33.679 --> 00:14:35.679
(emergency response measures.)

00:19:56.240 --> 00:20:00.880
(Darkness shut out the light
and what little sanity I had left.)

00:20:00.880 --> 00:20:03.520
(I thought I was heading for a way out.)

00:20:03.680 --> 00:20:06.280
(But the darkness only led me
into deeper darkness.)

00:20:06.280 --> 00:20:10.320
(Su Lin's Diary)

00:20:13.319 --> 00:20:13.920
Captain Wang,

00:20:14.880 --> 00:20:15.839
after treating you for so long,

00:20:16.480 --> 00:20:17.279
I'm practically a doctor now.

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:19.079
You should thank me.

00:20:20.440 --> 00:20:22.240
If you ever quit the force,

00:20:23.079 --> 00:20:24.160
you've got a second career.

00:20:25.559 --> 00:20:26.519
Fine. Thank you.

00:20:28.720 --> 00:20:29.440
Captain Wang,

00:20:29.680 --> 00:20:31.480
with an old injury like yours,

00:20:32.039 --> 00:20:32.680
you can't keep

00:20:32.680 --> 00:20:34.119
relying on a hack like me.

00:20:34.359 --> 00:20:34.799
Here?

00:20:35.519 --> 00:20:36.880
You need to see a doctor.

00:20:37.519 --> 00:20:38.480
Forget it.

00:20:39.519 --> 00:20:40.440
I don't have time for that.

00:20:42.759 --> 00:20:43.960
A few needles help a lot.

00:20:44.640 --> 00:20:45.079
Wang.

00:20:47.240 --> 00:20:47.880
We checked.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:49.039
You were right.

00:20:55.799 --> 00:20:56.279
Meeting.

00:20:56.799 --> 00:20:58.160
Link the Weihong Canal case

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:01.160
to the two female body cases

00:21:01.440 --> 00:21:01.960
from last year.

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:05.600
(Semen from all victims matched one man.)

00:21:07.960 --> 00:21:08.720
Paris.

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:10.880
Paris.

00:21:12.160 --> 00:21:12.839
The Louvre.

00:21:14.319 --> 00:21:15.079
The Louvre.

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:17.680
(blue, "bloo")

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:21.360
(yellow, "yeh-loh")

00:21:21.480 --> 00:21:23.000
(green, "green")

00:21:27.839 --> 00:21:28.519
Lin.

00:21:29.759 --> 00:21:33.119
What's Notre-Dame called in English?

00:21:33.519 --> 00:21:34.960
Teach me.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:41.839
Paris.

00:21:43.799 --> 00:21:44.720
The Louvre.

00:21:52.039 --> 00:21:52.599
Coming!

00:21:54.480 --> 00:21:55.079
Coming!

00:21:57.359 --> 00:21:57.920
Coming!

00:22:02.079 --> 00:22:03.440
What's going on with you?

00:22:03.640 --> 00:22:04.400
It's been days.

00:22:04.400 --> 00:22:05.440
Why haven't you taken

00:22:05.519 --> 00:22:06.279
laundry to the shop?

00:22:06.400 --> 00:22:07.480
You didn't even call.

00:22:07.559 --> 00:22:09.079
Our customers are asking for them.

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:11.160
What clothes?

00:22:11.680 --> 00:22:12.680
Are you Su?

00:22:13.720 --> 00:22:14.359
My name is Gu.

00:22:18.640 --> 00:22:19.759
The Su family lives there.

00:22:21.119 --> 00:22:21.839
I'll show you.

00:22:22.720 --> 00:22:23.160
Okay.

00:22:29.680 --> 00:22:30.400
Who is it?

00:22:30.759 --> 00:22:31.480
It's Gu.

00:22:32.400 --> 00:22:33.039
Coming.

00:22:36.079 --> 00:22:37.319
Gu, what brings you here?

00:22:37.480 --> 00:22:38.200
Here for you.

00:22:38.640 --> 00:22:39.440
Ma'am.

00:22:39.680 --> 00:22:40.880
What's going on?

00:22:41.480 --> 00:22:42.279
It's been days,

00:22:42.279 --> 00:22:43.839
and the laundry still isn't done.

00:22:43.880 --> 00:22:44.599
I'm so sorry.

00:22:44.640 --> 00:22:45.839
These days, my family...

00:22:46.839 --> 00:22:47.960
I've been sick.

00:22:48.000 --> 00:22:49.160
I caught a cold.

00:22:49.200 --> 00:22:50.079
My head hurts.

00:22:50.119 --> 00:22:51.519
I'm washing them now.

00:22:52.000 --> 00:22:53.680
If you're sick and can't work,

00:22:53.680 --> 00:22:55.519
you could at least call me.

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:56.440
Then the shop

00:22:56.440 --> 00:22:58.519
could make other arrangements.

00:22:58.519 --> 00:22:59.400
I'm sorry.

00:22:59.400 --> 00:23:00.000
I fell behind.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:00.920
Tomorrow night,

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:02.920
I'll deliver them. I promise.

00:23:03.039 --> 00:23:03.759
All right.

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:05.000
Get back to washing.

00:23:05.240 --> 00:23:06.519
Get them back tomorrow night.

00:23:06.599 --> 00:23:07.279
Okay. Thank you.

00:23:07.279 --> 00:23:07.920
I'm sorry.

00:23:08.039 --> 00:23:09.000
Go wash them.

00:23:09.160 --> 00:23:10.519
I'm sorry you came all this way.

00:23:10.519 --> 00:23:11.519
I truly am.

00:23:11.839 --> 00:23:12.680
Don't see me out.

00:23:12.680 --> 00:23:14.079
Just finish the laundry.

00:23:14.079 --> 00:23:15.839
It won't happen again.

00:23:15.839 --> 00:23:16.400
Get back.

00:23:24.319 --> 00:23:25.039
Hey.

00:23:25.079 --> 00:23:25.680
Gu.

00:23:25.680 --> 00:23:26.559
Are you sick?

00:23:28.119 --> 00:23:28.799
Yes.

00:23:29.079 --> 00:23:29.920
Did you see a doctor?

00:23:31.960 --> 00:23:32.880
I don't need to.

00:23:32.880 --> 00:23:33.680
Thank you.

00:23:34.319 --> 00:23:35.279
If you need,

00:23:35.279 --> 00:23:36.319
we might have some medicine.

00:23:36.480 --> 00:23:37.559
Send Lin over for it.

00:23:39.039 --> 00:23:39.680
No need.

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:41.119
We have some at home.

00:23:41.319 --> 00:23:42.240
Thank you, Gu.

00:24:11.720 --> 00:24:14.320
(May 27, 1994)

00:24:22.440 --> 00:24:24.000
(England, "Ing-glan-de")

00:24:24.000 --> 00:24:25.360
(Big Ben, "big-uh ben", May 22)

00:24:25.759 --> 00:24:26.880
The twenty-second.

00:24:45.279 --> 00:24:45.839
Boys and girls.

00:24:47.519 --> 00:24:48.920
Today, several teachers and I

00:24:49.400 --> 00:24:51.160
observed your English reading classes.

00:24:51.920 --> 00:24:52.880
From what we saw,

00:24:53.799 --> 00:24:54.640
you are

00:24:54.839 --> 00:24:55.440
the best ones

00:24:55.440 --> 00:24:57.039
in spoken English.

00:24:58.440 --> 00:24:59.200
The school

00:24:59.559 --> 00:25:00.720
is organizing

00:25:01.079 --> 00:25:02.079
an English recitation contest.

00:25:02.839 --> 00:25:04.400
We're forming a temporary team.

00:25:05.799 --> 00:25:07.000
If you're interested,

00:25:07.359 --> 00:25:08.480
you can sign up now

00:25:08.960 --> 00:25:09.680
and join us.

00:25:10.519 --> 00:25:12.599
We'll prepare for the contest together.

00:25:13.680 --> 00:25:15.160
The school already held

00:25:15.359 --> 00:25:16.799
an open registration,

00:25:17.759 --> 00:25:19.599
and the team was full.

00:25:20.240 --> 00:25:22.160
But something has changed.

00:25:22.680 --> 00:25:23.720
A spot has opened up.

00:25:24.480 --> 00:25:26.160
I think

00:25:26.200 --> 00:25:27.119
this is your opportunity.

00:25:27.960 --> 00:25:30.880
This is a provincial contest.

00:25:31.559 --> 00:25:32.759
If we win an award,

00:25:33.400 --> 00:25:35.440
you'll earn extra entrance-exam points.

00:25:36.640 --> 00:25:37.880
Anyone aiming for college

00:25:38.559 --> 00:25:39.680
should consider it.

00:25:40.079 --> 00:25:41.599
We can get bonus exam points?

00:25:42.440 --> 00:25:44.039
I'm not going to college.

00:25:44.359 --> 00:25:45.920
I'll work right after graduation.

00:25:46.279 --> 00:25:47.079
I'm not interested.

00:25:49.720 --> 00:25:51.160
That's everything.

00:25:51.880 --> 00:25:52.440
After all,

00:25:53.039 --> 00:25:54.880
if Su Lin

00:25:54.960 --> 00:25:56.680
hadn't dropped out of school,

00:25:57.400 --> 00:25:59.039
this spot wouldn't be open.

00:25:59.119 --> 00:26:00.160
Su Lin?

00:26:00.920 --> 00:26:02.079
Why'd she drop out?

00:26:02.680 --> 00:26:04.240
Her family couldn't afford it.
She had to go to work.

00:26:04.599 --> 00:26:05.359
Last month,

00:26:05.359 --> 00:26:06.480
a classmate dropped out
last month, too.

00:26:07.759 --> 00:26:08.279
All right.

00:26:09.240 --> 00:26:10.759
That's all I wanted to say.

00:26:11.200 --> 00:26:11.920
I hope you

00:26:12.599 --> 00:26:13.759
seize this chance.

00:26:14.319 --> 00:26:15.200
We'll go home

00:26:15.319 --> 00:26:16.440
and ask our parents.

00:26:18.279 --> 00:26:19.079
Sir.

00:26:20.759 --> 00:26:21.559
I'd like to try.

00:26:23.839 --> 00:26:24.319
Great.

00:26:25.279 --> 00:26:26.839
Die! You're dead!

00:26:31.599 --> 00:26:32.839
Stop fooling around.

00:26:34.240 --> 00:26:35.079
Dinner was ages ago,

00:26:35.079 --> 00:26:36.400
and you've barely written anything.

00:26:37.279 --> 00:26:38.880
You've got some nerve.

00:26:38.880 --> 00:26:39.400
I'm serious.

00:26:39.400 --> 00:26:40.559
- Stop fooling around.
- Take this!

00:26:40.559 --> 00:26:41.319
Start writing.

00:26:41.559 --> 00:26:43.519
Before Dad comes home and smacks you.

00:26:54.279 --> 00:26:55.000
You're back.

00:26:56.920 --> 00:26:58.119
Dinner's on the table.

00:27:06.279 --> 00:27:07.079
You've left so much blank.

00:27:07.599 --> 00:27:08.559
I don't know how to do it.

00:27:08.839 --> 00:27:09.920
My sister will teach me.

00:27:10.240 --> 00:27:11.440
Can't you think for yourself?

00:27:11.680 --> 00:27:12.880
I just don't know.

00:27:12.960 --> 00:27:14.200
If she never comes back,

00:27:14.319 --> 00:27:15.799
you'll never learn?

00:27:16.400 --> 00:27:17.519
That's enough.

00:27:18.039 --> 00:27:19.400
Go do your homework inside.

00:27:19.599 --> 00:27:21.000
Your dad needs the table to eat.

00:27:21.799 --> 00:27:22.880
Go on. Hurry.

00:27:23.240 --> 00:27:24.279
Go write inside.

00:27:24.599 --> 00:27:25.880
Stop playing and get it done.

00:27:30.759 --> 00:27:31.359
Honey.

00:27:32.319 --> 00:27:33.200
If this keeps up,

00:27:33.279 --> 00:27:34.759
we can't even hide this from Su Zhe.

00:27:37.160 --> 00:27:38.599
I've been looking for her these days.

00:27:39.519 --> 00:27:40.279
Parks,

00:27:40.559 --> 00:27:41.359
bridges,

00:27:41.880 --> 00:27:44.400
hotels and restaurants... everywhere.

00:27:44.720 --> 00:27:46.880
No one's seen Lin.

00:27:49.319 --> 00:27:51.119
I have no idea where she could've gone.

00:27:52.200 --> 00:27:54.400
I've had a bad feeling these days.

00:27:54.799 --> 00:27:57.039
What if something's happened to her?

00:27:57.519 --> 00:27:59.240
She's my daughter. I know her.

00:27:59.240 --> 00:28:01.000
She never causes trouble.

00:28:01.519 --> 00:28:02.440
Don't worry.

00:28:03.160 --> 00:28:04.279
I'll search again later.

00:28:04.640 --> 00:28:06.880
What if Ma lied to us?

00:28:07.079 --> 00:28:08.400
What if there's more to it?

00:28:08.400 --> 00:28:09.680
His daughter may have

00:28:09.680 --> 00:28:10.680
done something to Lin.

00:28:10.920 --> 00:28:11.960
Otherwise, why would he

00:28:11.960 --> 00:28:13.160
do so much for us?

00:28:13.400 --> 00:28:14.799
Stop thinking like that.

00:28:15.599 --> 00:28:16.480
(The body recovered)

00:28:16.839 --> 00:28:17.720
(days ago)

00:28:17.759 --> 00:28:19.559
(has been transferred to authorities.)

00:28:19.799 --> 00:28:20.640
(However, to date,)

00:28:20.799 --> 00:28:22.559
(the victim remains unidentified.)

00:28:22.680 --> 00:28:25.279
(She is believed to have been
18 to 20 years old,)

00:28:25.519 --> 00:28:26.920
(about 1.64 meters tall,)

00:28:27.039 --> 00:28:28.839
(and weighed 40 to 45 kilograms.)

00:28:29.119 --> 00:28:30.640
(Anyone with information)

00:28:30.839 --> 00:28:33.640
(or anyone with
a missing family member or friend)

00:28:33.920 --> 00:28:35.759
(please contact the police.)

00:28:36.680 --> 00:28:38.079
Eighteen to twenty.

00:28:38.559 --> 00:28:39.759
1.64 meters.

00:28:40.480 --> 00:28:41.680
Just over 40 kilos.

00:28:43.519 --> 00:28:45.319
Honey, could it be...

00:28:55.279 --> 00:28:56.440
I'm not lying, Su.

00:28:56.519 --> 00:28:57.319
Don't stop me.

00:28:57.599 --> 00:28:58.839
I need to see Ma Dongchen.

00:29:00.400 --> 00:29:00.839
Ma...

00:29:01.599 --> 00:29:03.160
(Hard Work Pays Off)
Su, why are you here?

00:29:03.440 --> 00:29:04.640
Did you see the news?

00:29:04.720 --> 00:29:06.039
Something's happened to my daughter!

00:29:06.039 --> 00:29:06.519
Go. Go.

00:29:06.680 --> 00:29:07.119
Get out.

00:29:07.319 --> 00:29:07.720
Get out.

00:29:08.200 --> 00:29:08.880
Let go of me!

00:29:10.519 --> 00:29:11.279
Close the door.

00:29:16.799 --> 00:29:17.640
A young woman's body

00:29:17.640 --> 00:29:19.319
was found in Weihong Canal.

00:29:20.599 --> 00:29:22.480
You think it's Su Lin?

00:29:22.920 --> 00:29:23.680
Her height and age

00:29:23.720 --> 00:29:25.240
are close to Lin's.

00:29:26.160 --> 00:29:27.559
You've got quite an imagination.

00:29:28.640 --> 00:29:29.880
If it were Lin,

00:29:29.960 --> 00:29:31.559
the police would've found you at once.

00:29:31.720 --> 00:29:33.240
Do you think they're useless?

00:29:38.880 --> 00:29:40.079
I saw the news

00:29:40.440 --> 00:29:41.559
and checked into it.

00:29:41.960 --> 00:29:43.119
It isn't Su Lin.

00:29:43.519 --> 00:29:44.319
I've said it enough.

00:29:44.559 --> 00:29:45.880
The girls only argued.

00:29:46.039 --> 00:29:47.480
How could that end in death?

00:29:47.680 --> 00:29:48.920
Think about it.

00:29:50.839 --> 00:29:51.880
Are you lying to me?

00:29:52.079 --> 00:29:53.440
Why would I lie about this?

00:29:56.920 --> 00:29:58.200
(Household Register)

00:30:01.880 --> 00:30:02.920
The fine is paid.

00:30:04.079 --> 00:30:06.000
I had his registration expedited.

00:30:06.319 --> 00:30:07.759
Your son can attend school now.

00:30:09.599 --> 00:30:11.759
I always keep my promises.

00:30:11.759 --> 00:30:12.519
(Household Register)

00:30:12.519 --> 00:30:14.440
Don't forget your promise to me.

00:30:17.600 --> 00:30:18.720
(Household Register)

00:30:18.720 --> 00:30:20.279
You know

00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:21.160
(Resident: Su Zhe)
how this got approved.

00:30:21.880 --> 00:30:24.079
Don't tell outsiders about Su Lin.

00:30:26.160 --> 00:30:26.759
Rest assured.

00:30:26.880 --> 00:30:28.319
I'll keep searching for your girl.

00:30:30.440 --> 00:30:31.960
(100 yuan)
Your son can go to school.

00:30:32.039 --> 00:30:33.480
Don't waste this opportunity.

00:30:40.880 --> 00:30:41.559
Come have tea.

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:53.200
Everyone, gather around

00:31:01.920 --> 00:31:02.480
Everyone,

00:31:03.160 --> 00:31:05.119
this is Jiang Ting, our new classmate.

00:31:05.839 --> 00:31:06.599
From now on,

00:31:07.119 --> 00:31:09.200
she'll be reading the lines for Maid C.

00:31:10.079 --> 00:31:11.559
Be kind and work together.

00:31:12.039 --> 00:31:12.880
Help one another.

00:31:14.400 --> 00:31:14.880
What are you looking at?

00:31:14.880 --> 00:31:15.759
Get lost!

00:31:16.200 --> 00:31:17.000
Welcome, Jiang Ting.

00:31:27.880 --> 00:31:28.759
When the ship parted,

00:31:28.759 --> 00:31:30.039
she had seen him

00:31:30.279 --> 00:31:34.480
sink into the deep waves,

00:31:34.839 --> 00:31:36.640
and she was glad

00:31:36.880 --> 00:31:39.880
for she thought
he would now be with her.

00:31:41.079 --> 00:31:42.400
(Su Lin's English is excellent.)

00:31:42.519 --> 00:31:43.839
(Of course she stays in it.)

00:31:44.119 --> 00:31:45.519
(She'll play Maid C.)

00:31:46.279 --> 00:31:47.240
(Maid C.)

00:31:52.920 --> 00:31:54.200
(Bye, Maid C.)

00:32:15.440 --> 00:32:15.880
All right.

00:32:16.519 --> 00:32:18.039
That's all for today's rehearsal.

00:32:19.119 --> 00:32:20.599
Would anyone

00:32:20.720 --> 00:32:21.960
like to volunteer

00:32:22.160 --> 00:32:23.920
to show Jiang Ting

00:32:24.400 --> 00:32:25.960
around the school?

00:32:26.559 --> 00:32:27.200
I'll do it.

00:32:28.119 --> 00:32:28.480
Good.

00:32:29.599 --> 00:32:30.519
Good work, everyone.

00:32:30.960 --> 00:32:33.160
Thank you.

00:32:33.559 --> 00:32:34.079
Dismissed.

00:32:39.640 --> 00:32:40.440
Jiang Ting, come on.

00:32:44.279 --> 00:32:45.480
Mind your own business.

00:32:47.720 --> 00:32:48.119
Let's go.

00:32:58.000 --> 00:32:58.880
Where is Su Lin?

00:33:04.640 --> 00:33:06.000
What do you think?

00:33:08.680 --> 00:33:10.799
Come on. I'll show you around.

00:33:11.840 --> 00:33:13.759
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

00:33:13.759 --> 00:33:15.079
This is victim one, Du Yuan.

00:33:15.240 --> 00:33:16.480
Thirty-three, married,

00:33:16.480 --> 00:33:17.839
with a four-year-old child.

00:33:18.560 --> 00:33:18.800
(Du Yuan, 33,
Textile Research Institute staff)

00:33:18.800 --> 00:33:20.599
(Missing: Mar 16, 1993)
On March 17, 1993,

00:33:20.599 --> 00:33:23.079
(Found: Apr 9, 1993)
her husband reported to Heping Police.

00:33:24.160 --> 00:33:26.240
(Sun Hui, 31, kindergarten teacher)
This is victim two, Sun Hui.

00:33:26.440 --> 00:33:27.880
(Missing: Aug 10, 1993)
31, unmarried.

00:33:27.880 --> 00:33:30.000
(Found: Aug 22, 1993)
She taught at Kindergarten No. 1.

00:33:31.920 --> 00:33:33.799
On May 24 this year,

00:33:33.920 --> 00:33:34.880
at Weihong Canal's floodgate,

00:33:34.960 --> 00:33:36.160
another body was found.

00:33:36.440 --> 00:33:39.480
She's victim three in the linked case.

00:33:43.880 --> 00:33:44.599
Linked?

00:33:46.440 --> 00:33:47.440
On what basis?

00:33:51.359 --> 00:33:52.839
Victim one's body

00:33:53.000 --> 00:33:54.359
was found in Baicang River,

00:33:54.519 --> 00:33:55.480
a tributary of Weihong Canal.

00:33:57.319 --> 00:33:58.920
Victim two's body

00:33:59.000 --> 00:34:00.839
was found on the shallows

00:34:00.839 --> 00:34:02.240
near a bridge pier

00:34:02.240 --> 00:34:02.720
in Weihong Canal.

00:34:02.960 --> 00:34:04.400
Both bodies

00:34:04.680 --> 00:34:05.880
had unusual abrasions.

00:34:06.319 --> 00:34:08.079
We couldn't determine the cause then.

00:34:09.039 --> 00:34:10.800
But all three victims

00:34:11.320 --> 00:34:13.599
died of mechanical asphyxia.

00:34:14.199 --> 00:34:14.960
The weapon

00:34:15.239 --> 00:34:16.360
appears to have been

00:34:16.880 --> 00:34:18.079
wire or something similar.

00:34:18.400 --> 00:34:19.360
Testing showed

00:34:19.400 --> 00:34:21.079
they were sexually assaulted.

00:34:22.719 --> 00:34:24.440
The semen

00:34:24.440 --> 00:34:26.159
recovered from the victims

00:34:26.400 --> 00:34:27.719
was confirmed to have come

00:34:27.760 --> 00:34:28.639
from the same man.

00:34:29.559 --> 00:34:30.679
He has type A blood.

00:34:31.159 --> 00:34:32.480
He assaulted, then killed them.

00:34:33.400 --> 00:34:34.360
What a monster.

00:34:35.360 --> 00:34:36.880
The third victim

00:34:37.159 --> 00:34:38.360
gave us a new lead.

00:34:38.719 --> 00:34:39.840
Weihong Canal's floodgate

00:34:40.039 --> 00:34:41.519
was installed last November.

00:34:42.559 --> 00:34:44.000
We checked

00:34:44.000 --> 00:34:45.400
the weather conditions

00:34:45.400 --> 00:34:46.320
before the two murders.

00:34:47.199 --> 00:34:48.920
The weather on both occasions

00:34:49.599 --> 00:34:51.679
was the same as on May 23:

00:34:52.119 --> 00:34:53.079
heavy to torrential rain.

00:34:54.239 --> 00:34:57.000
I suspect
the killer raped and murdered them,

00:34:57.800 --> 00:34:58.960
then dumped them in sewers.

00:34:59.880 --> 00:35:00.880
The rain

00:35:00.880 --> 00:35:02.159
flushed the bodies out

00:35:02.599 --> 00:35:03.760
in different directions.

00:35:05.079 --> 00:35:05.679
Since

00:35:05.679 --> 00:35:07.239
the floodgate was installed,

00:35:07.679 --> 00:35:09.440
the body got trapped there.

00:35:11.000 --> 00:35:13.159
Based on that theory,

00:35:13.840 --> 00:35:14.880
the examiner confirmed

00:35:15.960 --> 00:35:18.639
the first two victims' abrasions

00:35:18.880 --> 00:35:20.320
came from hitting

00:35:20.599 --> 00:35:21.559
the pipe walls.

00:35:23.119 --> 00:35:24.320
Given all these facts,

00:35:24.599 --> 00:35:25.800
we linked the cases.

00:35:28.000 --> 00:35:29.079
There's no time to lose.

00:35:29.880 --> 00:35:31.119
We have a serial killer.

00:35:31.519 --> 00:35:32.280
The killer

00:35:32.760 --> 00:35:34.000
could strike again anytime.

00:35:35.079 --> 00:35:36.159
I have another concern.

00:35:37.239 --> 00:35:38.480
We don't know

00:35:39.280 --> 00:35:40.440
if more victims are below.

00:35:41.079 --> 00:35:42.280
You want to go below?

00:35:47.079 --> 00:35:47.599
Deputy Director Hu.

00:35:48.280 --> 00:35:49.679
We only searched the pipes

00:35:49.679 --> 00:35:51.280
near the floodgate where she was found.

00:35:51.760 --> 00:35:53.239
So far, we found no other clues.

00:35:53.920 --> 00:35:55.800
The Planning Bureau says

00:35:55.840 --> 00:35:57.960
the sewer network is vast and complex.

00:35:58.320 --> 00:35:59.519
The air quality is poor, too.

00:36:00.639 --> 00:36:02.480
With enough manpower

00:36:02.639 --> 00:36:03.239
and time...

00:36:03.239 --> 00:36:04.000
The area's huge.

00:36:04.840 --> 00:36:06.119
We don't have the manpower.

00:36:10.679 --> 00:36:12.199
Then keep canvassing.

00:36:12.760 --> 00:36:14.159
Reinvestigate last year's cases.

00:36:14.519 --> 00:36:16.079
Check everyone who contacted them,

00:36:16.440 --> 00:36:18.239
and anyone with a sexual assault record.

00:36:49.119 --> 00:36:49.760
How'd it go?

00:36:50.199 --> 00:36:50.960
As expected,

00:36:51.239 --> 00:36:52.280
almost no leads.

00:36:53.559 --> 00:36:54.400
How about this?

00:36:54.800 --> 00:36:56.119
We head back and sort this out.

00:36:58.440 --> 00:36:58.920
Tai Wei.

00:36:59.320 --> 00:37:00.079
What caught your eye?

00:37:00.639 --> 00:37:02.360
(Route 42, Chaobei Stop)
The bus Sun Hui took.

00:37:20.199 --> 00:37:20.880
Last stop.

00:37:22.199 --> 00:37:22.800
It's the last stop.

00:37:24.280 --> 00:37:26.079
From here to Sun Hui's rental

00:37:26.079 --> 00:37:27.119
is about ten minutes.

00:37:28.239 --> 00:37:29.159
Making a living

00:37:29.280 --> 00:37:30.079
isn't easy.

00:38:26.760 --> 00:38:27.920
(Attention, listeners.)

00:38:28.159 --> 00:38:29.960
(This is Chaobei Radio.)

00:38:30.599 --> 00:38:32.639
(A series of
serious crimes occurred recently.)

00:38:32.840 --> 00:38:33.960
(Police remind residents)

00:38:34.039 --> 00:38:35.159
(to stay alert)

00:38:35.320 --> 00:38:36.559
(and stay away from high-risk areas.)

00:38:36.920 --> 00:38:38.280
(If you must go out at night,)

00:38:38.400 --> 00:38:39.559
(travel in groups.)

00:38:39.920 --> 00:38:41.000
(Report any suspicious activity)

00:38:41.039 --> 00:38:42.079
(to the police promptly.)

00:38:52.239 --> 00:38:53.559
I think Sun Hui's

00:38:53.599 --> 00:38:55.000
travel route is strange.

00:38:55.000 --> 00:38:55.599
(Route 42 Terminus)

00:38:55.599 --> 00:38:57.239
If she left work on time,

00:38:57.639 --> 00:38:59.639
she'd be home before dark.

00:39:00.599 --> 00:39:01.800
The killer had no chance.

00:39:02.719 --> 00:39:03.719
If she worked late,

00:39:03.760 --> 00:39:04.880
the buses had stopped.

00:39:05.360 --> 00:39:06.039
Would she walk home?

00:39:07.519 --> 00:39:09.039
This is far from downtown.

00:39:09.559 --> 00:39:10.519
Few people come here.

00:39:11.360 --> 00:39:11.800
Look.

00:39:12.599 --> 00:39:14.199
There's a recycling station north,

00:39:14.639 --> 00:39:15.840
and to the east,

00:39:15.880 --> 00:39:16.840
a container yard.

00:39:17.280 --> 00:39:17.960
To the west,

00:39:17.960 --> 00:39:18.880
a collection depot.

00:39:19.840 --> 00:39:21.280
Hiding crimes here

00:39:21.800 --> 00:39:22.880
is far easier than downtown.

00:39:24.719 --> 00:39:25.639
Let him go!

00:39:25.639 --> 00:39:26.079
Hey!

00:39:26.119 --> 00:39:26.760
Let him go!

00:39:32.400 --> 00:39:32.960
Are you okay?

00:39:33.440 --> 00:39:34.039
Are you okay?

00:39:42.000 --> 00:39:43.199
Is that him?

00:39:43.360 --> 00:39:43.760
It's him.

00:39:48.400 --> 00:39:48.840
Who is he?

00:39:49.559 --> 00:39:50.400
Remember the fire

00:39:50.400 --> 00:39:51.800
at the city's water tower?

00:39:52.519 --> 00:39:54.000
He watched his father burn to death.

00:39:54.480 --> 00:39:55.239
Then he lost his mind.

00:39:56.199 --> 00:39:57.840
An orphanage raised him.

00:39:57.920 --> 00:39:59.519
Now he collects trash

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:01.039
and lives on aid.

00:40:02.840 --> 00:40:03.760
The haunted-tower story

00:40:03.920 --> 00:40:04.920
is about his family.

00:40:05.559 --> 00:40:06.440
They say his parents'

00:40:06.599 --> 00:40:07.440
spirits linger.

00:40:08.519 --> 00:40:09.199
We're cops.

00:40:09.199 --> 00:40:10.440
We don't spread superstition.

00:40:10.880 --> 00:40:11.239
Right.

00:40:11.559 --> 00:40:12.880
I mean he's had it rough.

00:40:13.039 --> 00:40:13.480
Enough.

00:40:13.599 --> 00:40:14.559
Pity the victims.

00:40:14.719 --> 00:40:14.920
Let's go.

00:40:15.159 --> 00:40:15.599
Keep digging.

00:40:24.160 --> 00:40:26.800
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

