00:40:40.480 --> 00:40:43.320
Most cities have one sewer network.

00:40:43.840 --> 00:40:44.800
Ours is unusual.

00:40:45.000 --> 00:40:46.599
It runs for 47 kilometers,

00:40:46.719 --> 00:40:47.760
five meters underground.

00:40:47.960 --> 00:40:49.000
Captain, where are you?

00:40:49.039 --> 00:40:49.960
Which way do I go?

00:40:50.159 --> 00:40:50.960
No signal here.

00:40:51.000 --> 00:40:52.239
We're under immense pressure.

00:40:52.679 --> 00:40:53.440
Don't make trouble.

